## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-idr-node-target-ext-comm`**: Working Group Last Call (WGLC) will be initiated by the chairs following the resolution of directorate review comments.
2. **`draft-ietf-idr-sr-policy-admin-flags`**:
   * Chairs will issue an early code point allocation request.
   * Chair Susan Hares will author a short IANA registry document for RFC 9252 flag bits.
3. **`draft-ietf-idr-5g-edge-service-metadata`**: Authors must update the path selection text to explicitly align with the BGP best-path selection algorithm in `draft-ietf-idr-bgp4-rfc4271bis`.
4. **`draft-ietf-idr-multinexthop-attribute`**: Authors to submit an early code point allocation request for ongoing implementations/trials and reorganize the document into a base framework and extension drafts.
5. **`draft-ietf-idr-bgp-ct-srv6`**: Authors and chairs will coordinate offline to decide between holding the draft for SPRING dependencies or splitting base CT procedures from SRv6 specifics.

